        "source": "wals-v2020.5",
        "note": "<div class=\"Example\"><table class=\"example\"><tr><td><p><i>ty</i></p></td><td><p>2nd sg.</p></td><td><p>- familiar form of address in Cornish, a language which has beenextinct since the 18th century</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><i>why</i></p></td><td><p>2nd sg. hon.</p></td><td><p>- polite form of address in Cornish; it is similar to the FrenchT/V model of pronoun usage)</p></td></tr></table></div>",
